<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Public Transport Co lifts 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Saudi Public Transport Co lifts 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 88.0   vs    71.9</p>
<p> Operating income	572.9   vs   526.6</p>
<p> Operating cost	  472.8   vs   445.7</p>
<p> Dividend		   70.0   vs    70.0</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 1,134.0   vs 1,119.3</p>
<p> Assets		  1,496.4   vs 1,591.2</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Public Transport Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based firm provides bus transportation in the kingdom. It is traded on the Saudi stock market.</p>
</text>
